OL,3,GNEWSATransport failings risked pupils'
OL,4,Asafety, says watchdog
OL,5,
OL,6,FUnder the transport provider 24x7,
OL,7,Froutes and drivers would change to save
OL,8,Fmoney, showing "a disregard" for the
OL,9,Fneeds of children that "rely on
OL,10,Fconsistency and routine".
OL,12,FThe council received more than 90
OL,13,Fcomplaints about the transport provider
OL,14,Fin autumn 2025 and more than 20 further
OL,15,Fcomplaints in January and February this
OL,16,Fyear.
